<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f5f0" />
    <title>Antonio Skilton — About &amp; projects</title>
    <meta name="description" content="I’m a technical program manager with a data science background. I lead machine learning deployments and build agentic solutions to help teams ship models at a Fortune 100 company." />
    <!-- Preview safeguard: remove this and the matching Vercel header only after launch approval. -->
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Antonio Skilton — About &amp; projects" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="I’m a technical program manager with a data science background. I lead machine learning deployments and build agentic solutions to help teams ship models at a Fortune 100 company." />
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 40 40'%3E%3Crect width='40' height='40' fill='%23f7f5f0'/%3E%3Ctext x='20' y='30' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='32' fill='%232b3630'%3EA%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --paper: #f7f5f0;
        --ink: #28342e;
        --body: #4d5650;
        --muted: #62675f;
        --rule: #d8d9ce;
        --accent: #913d30;
        --project: #e9eddf;
        --project-hover: #e1e7d6;
        --serif: "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", "Book Antiqua", Palatino, Georgia, serif;
        --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
      }
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { background: var(--paper); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
      body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
      ::selection { color: var(--ink); background: #dbe3cb; }
      a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .24em; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 6px; }
      svg { display: block; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .skip-link {
        position: fixed; z-index: 10; top: 12px; left: 12px;
        padding: 14px 18px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
        transform: translateY(-180%); font-size: 15px;
      }
      .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
      .page { width: min(100% - 112px, 960px); margin-inline: auto; }
      .intro { padding-block: 82px 80px; }
      .eyebrow {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0 0 28px;
        font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 28px; height: 2px; background: var(--accent); }
      h1 {
        margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(48px, 7.1vw, 90px); line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -.045em; font-kerning: normal;
      }
      .about-copy { max-width: 690px; margin-top: 32px; }
      .about-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: -.016em; }
      .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 17px; }
      .profile-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
      .profile-link {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
        min-height: 44px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,.36); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
      }
      .profile-link:first-child { border-color: #b7b9ae; }
      .profile-link svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; transition: transform 180ms ease; }
      .projects { padding-bottom: 58px; }
      .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
      .section-heading h2 {
        flex-shrink: 0; margin: 0; color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .section-heading::after { content: ""; height: 1px; width: 100%; background: var(--rule); }
      .project { margin: 0; }
      .project + .project { margin-top: 22px; }
      .project-link--harness { background: #ecefe7; }
      .project-link {
        position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 190px;
        column-gap: 38px; min-height: 300px; padding: 34px 38px 32px;
        background: var(--project); text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
      }
      .project-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
      .project-category {
        margin: 0 0 13px; color: var(--body); font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .095em; text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .project-title { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.036em; line-height: 1.13; }
      .project-description { max-width: 510px; margin: 17px 0 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; letter-spacing: -.005em; }
      .project-description + .project-description { margin-top: 10px; }
      .project-cta {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 44px;
        margin-top: 13px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 5px;
      }
      .project-cta svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; transition: transform 180ms ease; }
      /* An abstract publication, not a screenshot or a second interactive control. */
      .publication { align-self: center; justify-self: end; width: 168px; position: relative; isolation: isolate; }
      .publication::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: -1; inset: 8px -8px -8px 8px;
        background: #d9dfce; border: 1px solid #c5ceba; transform: rotate(4deg);
      }
      .publication-page {
        position: relative; min-height: 219px; padding: 19px 19px 17px;
        background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid #bfc8b5;
        transform: rotate(-5deg); box-shadow: 0 6px 15px #28342e08;
        transition: transform 180ms ease;
      }
      .publication-rule { height: 2px; width: 25px; background: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 17px; }
      .publication-name { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 33px; line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
      .publication-lines { margin-top: 25px; display: grid; gap: 5px; }
      .publication-lines span { height: 1px; background: #c9cdbf; }
      .publication-lines span:nth-child(3) { width: 81%; }
      .publication-lines span:nth-child(4) { margin-top: 4px; }
      .publication-lines span:last-child { width: 67%; }
      .publication-bottom { width: 100%; border-top: 1px solid #bfc8b5; margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 7px; color: var(--muted); font: 8px/1.2 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .project-tagline { margin: 17px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; }
      .project-definition { max-width: 510px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .harness-mark { align-self: center; justify-self: end; width: 168px; color: var(--ink); }
      .harness-mark svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
      .footer {
        display: flex; align-items: center;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-block: 25px 38px;
      }
      .footer-note { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .04em; line-height: 1.5; }
      @media (hover: hover) {
        .project-link:hover { background: var(--project-hover); border-color: #c5ceba; }
        .project-link:hover .project-cta svg { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }
        .project-link:hover .publication-page { transform: rotate(-2deg) translateY(-2px); }
        .profile-link:hover { color: var(--accent); background: rgba(255,255,255,.7); border-color: #b7b9ae; }
        .profile-link:hover svg { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1400px) { .intro { padding-top: 98px; } }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .page { width: calc(100% - 64px); }
        .intro { padding-block: 58px 57px; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 8.5vw, 65px); }
        .about-copy { margin-top: 25px; }
        .about-copy p { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .project-link { grid-template-columns: 1fr 133px; column-gap: 24px; padding: 28px; }
        .publication { width: 125px; }
        .harness-mark { width: 125px; }
        .publication-page { min-height: 175px; padding: 15px; }
        .publication-name { font-size: 28px; }
        .publication-lines { margin-top: 20px; }
        .publication-bottom { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 6px; }
      }
      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .page { width: calc(100% - 48px); }
        .intro { padding-block: 42px 45px; }
        .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 10px; gap: 10px; }
        .eyebrow::before { width: 22px; }
        h1 { max-width: 100%; font-size: clamp(43px, 11.3vw, 60px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.047em; }
        .about-copy { margin-top: 25px; }
        .about-copy p { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.65; letter-spacing: -.018em; }
        .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 16px; }
        .profile-links { margin-top: 23px; gap: 8px; }
        .profile-link { font-size: 13px; padding-inline: 12px; }
        .section-heading { margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .section-heading h2 { font-size: 10px; }
        .projects { padding-bottom: 35px; }
        .project-link { display: block; min-height: 0; padding: 27px 25px 23px; }
        .project-category { font-size: 9px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .project-title { font-size: 38px; }
        .project-description { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 16px; }
        .project-description + .project-description { margin-top: 9px; }
        .project-cta { margin-top: 14px; }
        .publication { display: none; }
        .harness-mark { width: 48px; margin-top: 21px; }
        .footer { align-items: flex-start; padding-block: 19px 25px; }
        .footer-note { font-size: 9px; }
      }
      @media (max-width: 350px) {
        .page { width: calc(100% - 36px); }
        h1 { font-size: 40px; }
        .project-link { padding-inline: 22px; }
        .profile-links { gap: 7px; }
        .footer { flex-wrap: wrap; }
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *, *::before, *::after { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
      }
      @media (forced-colors: active) {
        .project-link, .publication-page { border: 1px solid CanvasText; }
        .project-cta, .profile-link { color: LinkText; }
      }
      @media print {
        :root { --paper: #fff; --project: #fff; }
        .page { width: 100%; }
        .intro { padding-top: 0; }
        .project-link { border: 1px solid #aaa; }
        .skip-link, .publication { display: none; }
        .harness-mark { width: 48px; margin-top: 21px; }
        a[href^="https"]::after { content: " (" attr(href) ")"; font-size: 10px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="page">
      <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
        <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="name">
          <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
          <h1 id="name">Antonio Skilton</h1>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p>I’m a technical program manager with a data science background. I lead machine learning deployments and build agentic solutions to help teams ship models at a Fortune 100 company.</p>
          </div>
          <nav class="profile-links" aria-label="Explore more">
            <a class="profile-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonioskilton" rel="me">LinkedIn
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="profile-link" href="https://github.com/antonioskilton" rel="me">GitHub
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg>
            </a>
          </nav>
        </section>
        <section class="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="projects-title">Projects</h2></div>
          <article class="project">
            <!-- Keep the working reader address until the renamed domain is verified. -->
            <a class="project-link" href="https://reader.antonioskilton.com" aria-labelledby="long-form-title long-form-cta">
              <div class="project-copy">
                <h3 class="project-title" id="long-form-title">Long Form</h3>
                <p class="project-description">Your personal publication, run by an AI editor. A finite edition of original writing from sources you trust, composed around your curiosity. Read and discuss it here, or send the exact edition to Kindle.</p>
                <span class="project-cta" id="long-form-cta">Open Long Form
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="publication" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="publication-page">
                  <div class="publication-rule"></div>
                  <p class="publication-name">Long<br />Form</p>
                  <div class="publication-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                  <div class="publication-bottom">Kindle editions</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>
          <article class="project">
            <a class="project-link project-link--harness" href="https://github.com/phinneywood/outer-harness" aria-labelledby="outer-harness-title outer-harness-cta">
              <div class="project-copy">
                <p class="project-category">Assistant workflows</p>
                <h3 class="project-title" id="outer-harness-title">Outer Harness</h3>
                <p class="project-tagline">Pick up where you left off.</p>
                <p class="project-description">Give your AI assistant a way to follow ongoing projects, preserve useful decisions, and keep work moving across conversations.</p>
                <p class="project-definition">An outer harness is a set of instructions and tools that guides an AI assistant’s work.</p>
                <span class="project-cta" id="outer-harness-cta">See how it works
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" /></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="harness-mark" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M28 20h64a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v42a16 16 0 0 1-16 16H46l-24 17V94h-4A16 16 0 0 1 2 78V36a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h10Z" />
                  <path d="M45 37h27v39L58.5 66 45 76V37Z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>
        </section>
      </main>
      <footer class="footer">
        <p class="footer-note">© 2026 Antonio Skilton</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
